{"seq":2,"slug":"parallel-prohibition","title":"平行运动禁忌与对位基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/voice-leading/parallel-prohibition","wordCount":1662,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"平行运动禁忌与对位基础\">平行运动禁忌与对位基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>平行五度与平行八度的禁忌，本质上是对&quot;声部独立性&quot;这一目标的保护：纯五度、纯八度因频率比简洁而融合性极强，两声部平行进行会让四声部瞬间损失一个独立线条，造成厚度塌陷。理解禁忌的关键是把它放回声部运动的大框架——同向、反向、斜向、平行四种相对运动，其安全度依次递减。对位法则从&quot;旋律出发&quot;补充了另一种思维，与和声学&quot;从和弦出发&quot;互为镜像。后文隐伏五八、运动类型与对位入门都沿此展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平行五度与平行八度\">平行五度与平行八度</h2><p>在传统四部和声写作中，两个最著名的&quot;禁忌&quot;是<strong>平行五度</strong>（Parallel Fifths）与<strong>平行八度</strong>（Parallel Octaves）。它们指的是：两个声部同时以纯五度或纯八度的距离做同方向运动，使得连续两个和弦中这两个声部都保持相同的音程关系。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>平行五度：</mtext><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mi>F</mi></mfrac><mo>→</mo><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mi>G</mi></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>两声部间距始终为纯五度</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{平行五度：} \\frac{C}{F} \\to \\frac{D}{G} \\quad (\\text{两声部间距始终为纯五度})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平行五度：</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">两声部间距始终为纯五度</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>平行八度：</mtext><mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mfrac><mo>→</mo><mfrac><mi>D</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>两声部间距始终为八度</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{平行八度：} \\frac{C}{C&#x27;} \\to \\frac{D}{D&#x27;} \\quad (\\text{两声部间距始终为八度})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平行八度：</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6779em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6779em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">两声部间距始终为八度</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>禁忌的原因</strong>：纯五度和纯八度因频率比的简洁性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3:2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）而具有极强的&quot;融合性&quot;——两个声部像是合并为一个。平行进行会进一步加强这种融合，使得原本的四声部和声瞬间丧失一个独立声部，造成&quot;厚度塌陷&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;平行运动禁忌&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;平行五度&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;平行八度&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;两声部保持纯五度&lt;br/&gt;同方向运动&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;两声部保持八度&lt;br/&gt;同方向运动&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;后果:声部融合&lt;br/&gt;独立性丧失&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"平行运动禁忌\"] --&gt; B[\"平行五度\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"平行八度\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"两声部保持纯五度&lt;br/&gt;同方向运动\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"两声部保持八度&lt;br/&gt;同方向运动\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"后果:声部融合&lt;br/&gt;独立性丧失\"]\n    C --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"隐伏五八度\">隐伏五八度</h2><p>隐伏五度（Hidden Fifths）与隐伏八度（Hidden Octaves）是平行禁忌的&quot;弱化版本&quot;——两个声部同向运动到纯五度或纯八度，虽然之前不是这个音程，但到达这个融合性音程时的同向运动仍然会削弱声部独立性。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>隐伏五度：</mtext><mfrac><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></mfrac><mo>→</mo><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>不同音程 → 同向到纯五度</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{隐伏五度：} \\frac{C}{E} \\to \\frac{D}{A} \\quad (\\text{不同音程 → 同向到纯五度})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">隐伏五度：</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不同音程</span><span class=\"mord\"> → </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">同向到纯五度</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>适用范围</strong>：隐伏五八度的严格程度因声部位置而异：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>外声部（Soprano-Bass）之间：严格禁止</li>\n<li>内声部之间：可以接受</li>\n<li>外声部中若上方声部为级进：通常可以接受</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>严格程度</th>\n<th>检查范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平行五度</td>\n<td>五度→五度，同向</td>\n<td>绝对禁止</td>\n<td>所有声部对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平行八度</td>\n<td>八度→八度，同向</td>\n<td>绝对禁止</td>\n<td>所有声部对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐伏五度</td>\n<td>非五度→五度，同向</td>\n<td>外声部禁止</td>\n<td>Soprano-Bass</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐伏八度</td>\n<td>非八度→八度，同向</td>\n<td>外声部禁止</td>\n<td>Soprano-Bass</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"声部运动的四种类型\">声部运动的四种类型</h2><p>两个声部之间的相对运动关系可以分为四种：</p>\n<p><strong>同向运动</strong>（Similar Motion）：两声部同方向移动。平行是同向的特例（保持音程不变）。</p>\n<p><strong>反向运动</strong>（Contrary Motion）：两声部相反方向移动。最能保证声部独立性，是&quot;安全&quot;的选择。</p>\n<p><strong>斜向运动</strong>（Oblique Motion）：一个声部保持不动，另一个声部移动。利用共同音保持时自然产生。</p>\n<p><strong>平行运动</strong>（Parallel Motion）：两声部同向且保持相同音程。除了五度和八度之外，三度平行和六度平行是美妙的和声效果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 四种声部运动&#10;        A[&quot;同向&lt;br/&gt;同方向不同距离&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;反向&lt;br/&gt;相反方向&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;斜向&lt;br/&gt;一动一不动&quot;]&#10;        D[&quot;平行&lt;br/&gt;同向同距&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 四种声部运动\n        A[\"同向&lt;br/&gt;同方向不同距离\"]\n        B[\"反向&lt;br/&gt;相反方向\"]\n        C[\"斜向&lt;br/&gt;一动一不动\"]\n        D[\"平行&lt;br/&gt;同向同距\"]\n    end</pre><p><strong>安全度排序</strong>：反向 &gt; 斜向 &gt; 同向 &gt; 平行（五八度）</p>\n<h2 id=\"对位法入门\">对位法入门</h2><p>对位法（Counterpoint）是研究多个独立旋律线条如何和谐共存的学问。与和声学&quot;从和弦出发思考&quot;不同，对位法&quot;从旋律出发思考&quot;——每个声部都是一条有意义的旋律线，而这些线条的纵向交汇恰好形成和谐的音响。</p>\n<p>传统对位学习按照种别（Species）循序渐进：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>种别</th>\n<th>对位声部节奏</th>\n<th>训练目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一种</td>\n<td>1:1（音对音）</td>\n<td>协和音程选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二种</td>\n<td>2:1</td>\n<td>经过音、弱拍不协和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三种</td>\n<td>4:1</td>\n<td>更快速的经过与辅助音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第四种</td>\n<td>切分</td>\n<td>延留音与切分不协和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第五种</td>\n<td>花式（混合）</td>\n<td>综合运用所有技法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"对位原则在现代编曲中的应用\">对位原则在现代编曲中的应用</h2><p>虽然严格对位法是 16-18 世纪的教学产物，但其核心原则在现代音乐编曲中仍然极具实用价值：</p>\n<p><strong>原则一：声部独立性</strong> 好的编曲中，每个乐器声部应该有自己的节奏特征与旋律走向，而非所有声部齐奏同一节奏。这正是对位思维的核心。</p>\n<p><strong>原则二：互补运动</strong> 当主旋律在高音区活跃时，低音部分应保持相对平稳（斜向运动）；当旋律静止在长音上时，伴奏可以增加活跃度（填充空间）。</p>\n<p><strong>原则三：声部交错</strong> 不同乐器的旋律线在时间上交错——一个声部结束乐句时，另一个声部恰好进入新乐句（类似赋格的&quot;答题&quot;）。</p>\n<p>在 2024-2025 年的流行音乐制作中，对位思维体现在：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vocal layers 之间的节奏交错（如 Imogen Heap 的人声编排）</li>\n<li>合成器旋律线与人声旋律线的互补关系</li>\n<li>低音线（Bass line）的独立旋律性（如 Thundercat 的 Bass 风格）</li>\n<li>弦乐编曲中各声部的独立运动（如 Owen Pallett 的编曲）</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对位原则</th>\n<th>现代编曲对应</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>声部独立</td>\n<td>各乐器不同节奏</td>\n<td>Radiohead 的乐队编曲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互补运动</td>\n<td>旋律静止时伴奏活跃</td>\n<td>大多数好编曲的标配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模仿对位</td>\n<td>乐器间主题传递</td>\n<td>弦乐四重奏式流行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向运动</td>\n<td>Bass 与旋律反向</td>\n<td>Neo-Soul 低音线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>平行五度/八度因纯音程的强融合性而丧失声部独立性，属绝对禁忌。</li>\n<li>隐伏五八是同向到达纯五/八度，外声部严格禁止、内声部可接受。</li>\n<li>四种声部运动安全度排序：反向 &gt; 斜向 &gt; 同向 &gt; 平行（五八度）。</li>\n<li>三度、六度平行是美妙效果，不受禁忌约束。</li>\n<li>对位法从旋律出发，按五种种别循序渐进（音对音到花式）。</li>\n<li>对位三原则（声部独立、互补运动、声部交错）在现代编曲中依然实用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>平行禁忌是声部连接四原则的延伸约束，先掌握基础原则：<a href=\"voice-leading-principles\">声部连接原则</a></li>\n<li>纯五度、纯八度的&quot;融合性&quot;源自其简单频率比（3:2、2:1），可从泛音角度理解：<a href=\"../../audio-signal-processing/spectral-analysis/fft-fundamentals\">频谱分析基础</a></li>\n<li>对位法&quot;从旋律出发&quot;的思维在编曲中体现为旋律与对旋律的写作：<a href=\"../../arrangement-orchestration/texture-voicing/melody-countermelody-counterpoint\">旋律、对旋律与对位</a></li>\n<li>非和弦音（经过音、延留音）是对位声部中弱拍不协和的来源：<a href=\"non-chord-tones\">非和弦音与装饰技法</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"平行运动禁忌与对位基础","id":"平行运动禁忌与对位基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"平行五度与平行八度","id":"平行五度与平行八度"},{"level":2,"text":"隐伏五八度","id":"隐伏五八度"},{"level":2,"text":"声部运动的四种类型","id":"声部运动的四种类型"},{"level":2,"text":"对位法入门","id":"对位法入门"},{"level":2,"text":"对位原则在现代编曲中的应用","id":"对位原则在现代编曲中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"声部连接原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/voice-leading/voice-leading-principles"},"next":{"title":"非和弦音与装饰技法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/voice-leading/non-chord-tones"}}